WEBVTT

00:23.080 --> 00:25.320
T is for teachers

00:25.400 --> 00:28.960
who always encourage students
to seek knowledge.

00:29.520 --> 00:32.680
They plant a seed
so it will become graciously strong.

00:33.080 --> 00:36.400
Even if it's so tiring, they never stop.

00:37.120 --> 00:40.160
They stick with the right discipline

00:40.840 --> 00:44.360
to find the principle of education.

00:45.160 --> 00:48.440
They are the role models
for being good citizens.

00:48.880 --> 00:52.800
They make us believe in a better world.

00:52.880 --> 00:54.000
Today,

00:54.080 --> 00:57.480
apart from the farewell party
for Ms. Kwan,

00:58.040 --> 01:00.840
we will also announce

01:01.480 --> 01:03.160
who gets the best teacher award this year,

01:03.720 --> 01:06.680
who will also become
the new deputy director.

01:06.760 --> 01:07.680
This award goes to...

01:15.480 --> 01:16.560
Ms. Aum.

01:16.800 --> 01:18.120
What are you doing here?

01:24.480 --> 01:25.360
-Shit!
-Fuck!

01:25.440 --> 01:29.560
T is for teachers
who teach ethics to others.

02:50.440 --> 02:52.400
-Good morning, Ms. Pim.
-Good morning.

02:52.480 --> 02:54.640
My mom wants to give you this.
It's a hand cream.

02:55.520 --> 02:56.800
They say it's very good.

02:56.880 --> 02:58.440
Please thank your mother for me.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.600
Sure. Goodbye.

03:03.760 --> 03:05.320
-Mr. Man.
-Yes?

03:05.400 --> 03:06.760
You were almost late.

03:07.200 --> 03:09.880
My girlfriend and I stayed up late
to watch a television drama.

03:10.520 --> 03:13.480
Ms. Aum, don't you watch
television dramas, too?

03:15.560 --> 03:17.000
I have no time for that.

03:18.640 --> 03:19.840
I thought so.

03:19.920 --> 03:21.720
All you do is work, right?

03:24.080 --> 03:26.000
I don't mind my work at all.

03:26.880 --> 03:29.400
But it's nonsense for us
to stand here like this.

03:30.240 --> 03:33.120
Greeting the students is one of the ways
to teach them good manners.

03:34.560 --> 03:37.360
Is it still good manners if they greet us
just for the sake of doing it?

03:46.920 --> 03:48.280
Hello, teachers.

03:48.880 --> 03:51.040
Are you the new student in classroom F?
What's your name?

03:51.960 --> 03:53.160
I'm Nanno.

04:06.440 --> 04:09.240
Good morning, teachers and students.

04:09.800 --> 04:13.440
I have an announcement
for everyone this morning.

04:13.520 --> 04:16.040
After this academic year,

04:16.600 --> 04:19.120
Ms. Kwan, our deputy director,
will retire.

04:19.680 --> 04:23.240
Our school will also throw her
a retirement party.

04:23.800 --> 04:26.440
Another announcement I want to make

04:27.000 --> 04:30.080
is that our school has conducted
a survey from the students.

04:30.640 --> 04:32.480
It can't be denied

04:32.560 --> 04:36.240
that the highlight in this survey
that everyone seems to be interested in

04:36.320 --> 04:38.600
is the vote for the most popular teacher.

04:39.040 --> 04:43.560
The teacher who wins
the best teacher award this year

04:44.040 --> 04:45.360
will receive a special prize

04:45.440 --> 04:51.000
sponsored by the Parents' Association.

04:51.080 --> 04:54.240
The prize is a package tour to Singapore

04:54.320 --> 04:58.040
for three days and two nights,
along with a cash prize of 30,000 baht.

05:11.400 --> 05:14.000
-Today, we'll learn about classification--
-Ms. Pim.

05:14.960 --> 05:15.800
Yes?

05:15.880 --> 05:18.160
Was the volunteer camp in Chiang Rai fun?

05:18.440 --> 05:20.440
It was fun. The weather was so nice.

05:20.760 --> 05:23.240
Please thank your dad for sponsoring us.

05:23.320 --> 05:24.960
Sure. I will tell him for you.

05:25.440 --> 05:27.080
So, how was it?

05:27.960 --> 05:31.080
At first, I thought it was going to be
a hard journey

05:31.160 --> 05:33.440
since the reforestation's location
was far away.

05:34.000 --> 05:37.200
But your dad prepared
amazing transportation and housing for us.

05:37.280 --> 05:40.440
In addition,
the locals cooked us every meal.

05:40.520 --> 05:42.040
It was very fun.

05:42.120 --> 05:44.400
The weather was amazing.
It was really foggy.

06:03.440 --> 06:05.800
Oh, is it time already?

06:06.600 --> 06:08.760
That's all right.
We'll continue it in our next class.

06:09.240 --> 06:11.400
Those who have a tutoring session
with me this evening,

06:11.880 --> 06:13.520
don't be late and don't skip class.

06:13.600 --> 06:14.720
It will be on the test.

06:14.800 --> 06:16.360
Don't skip class
if you want good grades, okay?

06:28.800 --> 06:29.720
All right, everyone.

06:30.080 --> 06:32.600
Turn your book to page 39
and look at the first question.

06:38.320 --> 06:40.120
Can anyone solve this problem?

06:40.720 --> 06:43.280
And how many methods
can we use to solve this problem?

06:51.920 --> 06:53.720
I don't know how to solve it.

06:54.320 --> 06:55.680
But I want to ask you

06:56.080 --> 06:58.000
if the volunteer camp
in Chiang Rai was fun.

06:58.920 --> 07:00.480
That's not related to this class.

07:13.120 --> 07:14.760
Why do we need to learn physics?

07:14.840 --> 07:15.680
It's difficult.

07:16.480 --> 07:18.320
We'll never use it in real life.

07:19.480 --> 07:22.160
I think you are underestimating physics.

07:24.880 --> 07:26.080
But that is no surprise.

07:27.480 --> 07:29.440
I believe that everyone

07:30.160 --> 07:31.320
agrees with him.

07:33.160 --> 07:35.040
Can anyone answer Chin's question?

07:38.840 --> 07:42.360
Fukushima or Chernobyl's
nuclear power plants.

07:45.080 --> 07:47.880
North Korea is testing
their nuclear weapons.

07:49.960 --> 07:51.960
Do you think those things
are related to our lives?

07:55.840 --> 07:59.360
Physics is in our daily life.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.560
If we understand physics,

08:02.240 --> 08:03.960
there will be no coincidences
in this world.

08:04.880 --> 08:07.200
Look what you have done.

08:08.160 --> 08:10.440
Can anyone use a different method
to solve this problem?

08:11.760 --> 08:13.080
Come on, Ms. Aum.

08:13.560 --> 08:15.240
I can't even understand
what's on the board.

08:15.840 --> 08:17.360
You want me to find a different method?

08:21.120 --> 08:22.040
Don't.

08:23.680 --> 08:25.840
This is today's homework.

08:26.720 --> 08:30.720
I want everyone to think of at least one
different method

08:30.800 --> 08:32.320
to solve this problem.

08:33.919 --> 08:34.960
Chin,

08:35.679 --> 08:37.080
I have a special assignment for you.

08:39.000 --> 08:40.159
Come on, Ms. Aum.

08:40.760 --> 08:44.440
Is there any justice left in this world?

08:45.920 --> 08:48.040
Then do a special report

08:48.480 --> 08:50.960
on physics and our lives.

08:51.560 --> 08:53.520
Hand it in to me next week.

08:53.600 --> 08:54.720
Do you understand?

08:56.520 --> 08:57.560
I do.

08:58.920 --> 08:59.800
Great.

09:00.320 --> 09:02.920
All right. Everyone, turn to page 40.

09:03.800 --> 09:04.960
Look at question number three.

09:09.200 --> 09:11.160
Why did you want to see me, Director?

09:16.960 --> 09:20.400
MS. PIM 136 VOTES
MS. NAM 103 VOTES

09:20.480 --> 09:24.120
MR. MENG 24 VOTES
MS. AUM 1 VOTE

09:27.640 --> 09:29.840
But this survey is nonsense, Director.

09:32.560 --> 09:34.560
It's because you're stubborn like this.

09:35.600 --> 09:37.400
This survey isn't nonsense at all.

09:37.960 --> 09:40.160
If we can evaluate our students,

09:40.240 --> 09:42.680
then they can evaluate us as well.

09:44.520 --> 09:47.200
But I think we are taking
the wrong path, Director.

09:47.760 --> 09:49.600
Well, I think

09:50.480 --> 09:51.760
that your teaching style

09:52.760 --> 09:54.200
might be too harsh on the kids.

09:54.440 --> 09:56.400
Do you want me

09:56.920 --> 09:58.760
to only talk about myself in class

09:58.840 --> 10:00.720
and tell them
what will be on the test later

10:01.280 --> 10:02.680
in exchange for a tutoring fee

10:03.240 --> 10:04.240
and popularity

10:04.320 --> 10:05.960
like some teachers?

10:08.240 --> 10:10.880
What kind of students will be produced
by that method?

10:13.120 --> 10:14.120
I understand,

10:14.800 --> 10:16.120
but our world has changed so much.

10:18.840 --> 10:19.680
Ultimately,

10:20.480 --> 10:23.520
I want you

10:23.600 --> 10:27.760
to change your teaching style
so the kids can understand better

10:29.040 --> 10:32.080
and I want you to be more lively.

10:32.680 --> 10:33.760
Lately,

10:34.360 --> 10:36.360
you've been overstressed
like you used to be.

10:39.000 --> 10:40.000
Is something wrong?

10:42.240 --> 10:43.280
No, it's not.

10:47.640 --> 10:49.040
Has...

10:51.120 --> 10:52.320
your ex-husband

10:55.360 --> 10:56.600
contacted you?

10:58.560 --> 11:00.400
I already told you

11:00.760 --> 11:03.240
that he has no part in my life anymore.

11:05.440 --> 11:07.440
My child and I are fine.

11:12.080 --> 11:14.200
It's almost Christmas now.

11:14.280 --> 11:17.680
I want you to be more lively.

11:17.760 --> 11:21.240
Whatever happened in the past,
just leave it behind.

11:43.200 --> 11:44.640
Don't mind them.

11:44.960 --> 11:46.360
It's just...

11:46.840 --> 11:48.840
I mean, people talk nonsense.

11:50.320 --> 11:51.240
I know.

11:52.800 --> 11:55.640
I feel sorry about Jade,
your ex-husband, too.

11:58.840 --> 12:01.760
He shouldn't have ruined his future
by getting a student pregnant.

12:03.000 --> 12:03.880
I...

12:05.600 --> 12:08.160
I didn't mean to make you uncomfortable.

12:11.760 --> 12:13.960
I just want to tell you

12:14.040 --> 12:15.960
that that's my personal business.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.040
Right.

12:19.240 --> 12:20.120
I...

12:20.680 --> 12:22.320
I want to

12:22.400 --> 12:24.080
apologize to you about

12:24.760 --> 12:26.000
Jade. I...

12:26.520 --> 12:30.440
-I shouldn't have suggested him to tutor--
-I think we should focus

12:30.520 --> 12:33.040
on improving our educational system

12:33.600 --> 12:35.680
so we don't get a student like that again.

12:35.760 --> 12:36.720
Don't you think?

12:38.720 --> 12:39.600
Sure.

13:09.800 --> 13:11.160
Are you all right, Ms. Aum?

13:13.240 --> 13:14.400
You look pale.

13:14.800 --> 13:15.800
You...

13:16.160 --> 13:19.200
I saw that you weren't well
so I brought you medicine.

13:21.520 --> 13:23.160
Is anything bothering you?

13:23.880 --> 13:25.080
I saw you were talking to--

13:25.160 --> 13:27.320
I believe that's personal.

13:27.400 --> 13:28.440
It's none of your business.

13:30.120 --> 13:31.840
What are you talking about?

13:32.120 --> 13:34.400
I heard you were talking about
our educational system.

13:34.760 --> 13:38.360
I just want to let you know
that I admire you.

13:39.440 --> 13:41.320
I can't help but wonder

13:41.760 --> 13:43.920
why people don't realize

13:44.000 --> 13:45.720
how rotten

13:46.440 --> 13:48.240
our educational system is right now.

13:48.920 --> 13:50.640
You are the only hope.

13:54.320 --> 13:57.320
If you're done talking, you can leave.

14:10.320 --> 14:11.320
Hey!

14:11.920 --> 14:13.920
Where are you going?

14:14.000 --> 14:15.680
Are you going to live with that bitch?

14:15.760 --> 14:16.840
Are you?

14:19.520 --> 14:21.640
Dad, where are you going?

14:21.720 --> 14:23.880
Take me with you.

14:52.720 --> 14:53.960
Mom.

14:54.040 --> 14:56.560
Do I still have to do my homework
the same way?

14:56.640 --> 14:58.680
Of course. Let me see.

15:04.040 --> 15:06.800
WHAT IS THE COMPOSITION OF 16?

15:08.400 --> 15:10.080
WHAT IS THE TENS DIGIT OF 18?

15:12.280 --> 15:14.160
Why do we have to do this again?

15:14.760 --> 15:17.680
Because we must find answers on our own.

15:19.080 --> 15:20.240
That's right.

15:21.560 --> 15:22.960
Do you know that

15:23.440 --> 15:27.000
a good education
will be beneficial for your future?

15:28.000 --> 15:30.040
I don't want you to grow up

15:30.640 --> 15:32.760
and behave like some adults

15:33.960 --> 15:35.800
who act like they are uneducated.

15:38.080 --> 15:40.480
I will never let you be like that.
Do you understand?

15:47.480 --> 15:48.320
Here.

15:49.400 --> 15:51.560
When an adult gives you something,
what do you say?

15:52.160 --> 15:53.680
Thank you.

15:55.000 --> 15:56.320
Good boy.

16:46.040 --> 16:46.880
Excuse me.

17:16.560 --> 17:18.280
It's 198 baht and 50 satang.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.440
I received 200 baht.

17:37.240 --> 17:39.240
You are missing 50 satang.

17:52.040 --> 17:53.840
Which school did you graduate from?

17:54.160 --> 17:56.320
Who taught you to have
bad manners like this?

17:57.480 --> 17:59.680
This isn't about the 50 satang.

17:59.760 --> 18:01.760
It's about your inability
to give me all my change.

18:02.480 --> 18:05.320
If you don't have enough change,
then notify your customer.

18:05.400 --> 18:06.560
Do you understand?

18:07.440 --> 18:08.440
Do you want it or not?

18:10.240 --> 18:11.840
Did you not understand what I said?

18:12.200 --> 18:14.120
It's about you
not giving me all my change.

18:14.680 --> 18:16.040
I don't need your one baht.

18:16.120 --> 18:18.400
I need my 50 satang. Do you understand?

18:18.880 --> 18:21.520
How many times do I need to repeat myself?

18:21.600 --> 18:23.440
This is common sense.

18:23.520 --> 18:27.760
Do you hear me?
It's common sense in business.

18:27.840 --> 18:29.640
How did you graduate?

18:53.880 --> 18:54.720
Atom.

18:55.840 --> 18:57.240
Stop playing with your food.

18:59.840 --> 19:03.040
Mom, I miss Dad.

19:04.840 --> 19:06.840
I miss him.

19:08.480 --> 19:10.520
I miss him.

19:11.720 --> 19:13.160
Shut up right now!

19:13.720 --> 19:15.680
Don't talk about him again! Understand?

19:20.200 --> 19:23.520
You want to be with him so much?

19:23.600 --> 19:25.880
Why do you want to be
with a bad person like that?

19:26.760 --> 19:29.640
A bad person who left his wife and son

19:29.720 --> 19:31.120
to be with his mistress!

19:31.440 --> 19:33.120
How am I not good enough for you?

19:34.280 --> 19:36.280
Listen to me. Listen!

19:36.840 --> 19:40.520
Your dad is a bad person!
Do you understand?

20:02.480 --> 20:04.360
Don't run away from me, honey.

20:08.160 --> 20:09.400
Stay with me.

20:12.880 --> 20:14.360
I promise that

20:15.560 --> 20:20.640
I will not let you become
a low-quality adult like your dad

20:22.040 --> 20:23.640
and his mistress.

20:33.200 --> 20:34.920
I promise you.

20:44.920 --> 20:46.440
I promise you.

20:47.320 --> 20:48.640
I promise you.

21:00.120 --> 21:02.360
-Whose phone was that?
-Why didn't you turn off your phone?

21:02.440 --> 21:03.360
I did.

21:23.360 --> 21:24.600
It wasn't me.

21:24.680 --> 21:26.000
I don't know who sent us the text.

21:31.000 --> 21:32.200
PROFESSOR FROM A FAMOUS UNIVERSITY
WHO HAD AN AFFAIR WITH A STUDENT

21:32.280 --> 21:33.120
WILL BE EXPELLED

21:33.680 --> 21:36.640
Is the guy in the news your ex-husband?

21:41.360 --> 21:44.520
It's the news
that he got a student pregnant.

21:44.600 --> 21:47.080
What's wrong with Ms. Aum? Damn.

21:47.160 --> 21:48.440
Why did her husband leave her?

21:49.920 --> 21:52.360
He's a professor
but he got a student pregnant.

21:52.920 --> 21:55.320
-He just left his wife and child.
-She was dumped.

21:55.400 --> 21:58.280
-He just left his wife and child.
-Ms. Aum is so pathetic.

21:58.840 --> 22:01.120
Shut up right now!

22:39.360 --> 22:42.520
I think you should rest.

22:45.160 --> 22:46.560
What happened to me?

22:47.640 --> 22:51.040
You passed out after seeing
the picture from the phone.

22:53.200 --> 22:55.880
Every student
is talking about it right now.

22:56.960 --> 22:58.480
I want you to take a break

22:59.080 --> 23:00.240
until the news quiets down.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.840
You can come back to work after that.

23:04.320 --> 23:05.800
It will be good for you.

23:07.440 --> 23:08.440
Trust me.

23:10.720 --> 23:11.720
No.

23:13.640 --> 23:16.800
I will not stop teaching
because of somebody else's mistake.

23:19.040 --> 23:22.000
Also, I probably fainted

23:22.080 --> 23:24.640
because I have been working too hard,

23:25.280 --> 23:27.280
planning how to reform
our educational system.

23:27.760 --> 23:30.560
If I have a chance to be
the deputy director...

23:31.320 --> 23:33.920
You put your educational reform plan
on my desk this morning, right?

23:34.080 --> 23:34.960
I read it.

23:36.560 --> 23:39.080
I think our school

23:40.000 --> 23:44.480
might not be the best fit
for an extreme plan like yours.

23:49.880 --> 23:51.680
Ms. Pim's plan to reform
the educational system

23:52.240 --> 23:54.560
is popular among tutor schools

23:55.400 --> 23:58.000
and the Parents' Association
approves this.

24:01.000 --> 24:04.360
I don't want you to worry about it.

24:04.440 --> 24:06.280
Please let go of bad things for now.

24:10.920 --> 24:13.160
As for the position
of the deputy director,

24:13.720 --> 24:14.880
I think...

24:16.360 --> 24:19.360
there may be someone who is more...

24:20.640 --> 24:21.720
suitable for it than you.

24:26.840 --> 24:28.200
I don't want to bother you anymore.

24:29.800 --> 24:30.760
Please rest.

24:59.120 --> 25:00.720
Are you all right, Ms. Aum?

25:02.080 --> 25:04.080
You seem so stressed lately.

25:04.760 --> 25:06.240
And you stay after school every day.

25:07.120 --> 25:08.320
Are you preparing for a class?

25:11.600 --> 25:13.080
If you're done talking, you can leave.

25:16.040 --> 25:17.160
I have work to do.

25:19.520 --> 25:21.240
Did I do something wrong?

25:22.600 --> 25:24.360
Why do I feel like

25:25.200 --> 25:26.960
you don't like me at all?

25:29.640 --> 25:31.080
But it's fine.

25:32.480 --> 25:36.440
At least, we are lucky to have
someone like you in our school.

25:38.040 --> 25:39.160
It's hard to find...

25:39.680 --> 25:42.880
a teacher who would do so much
for the students and the school.

25:45.480 --> 25:48.560
If you become
the deputy director in the future,

25:49.920 --> 25:52.360
our school will be so much better.

25:53.560 --> 25:54.720
Don't you agree?

25:57.680 --> 25:59.000
That's it.

25:59.560 --> 26:01.320
I won't take up any more of your time.

26:52.000 --> 26:55.040
Someone like you
will never be the deputy director.

26:57.480 --> 26:59.880
Please take another look at yourself.

26:59.960 --> 27:02.400
It's good enough
that the director didn't fire you.

27:14.880 --> 27:17.480
Your husband left you
because of your personality.

27:18.080 --> 27:21.240
We feel sorry for him to have you
as his wife. A wife like that...

27:21.360 --> 27:24.640
You should die.
Your husband left you for a mistress.

27:24.720 --> 27:27.680
I would rather bite my tongue to death
instead of having a wife like you.

27:28.360 --> 27:30.520
Look. There she is.

27:30.960 --> 27:32.000
She's so pathetic.

27:32.080 --> 27:34.000
Her husband left her
and she got fired, too.

27:35.440 --> 27:37.600
Your husband has a mistress.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.920
You really suck.

27:41.560 --> 27:43.040
Your husband has a mistress.

28:13.640 --> 28:16.840
-Hey! What the fuck!
-Jesus!

28:16.920 --> 28:18.360
-Are you all right?
-Stay away.

28:18.480 --> 28:20.000
-Stop Ms. Aum.
-Ms. Aum!

28:20.160 --> 28:21.320
-Calm down.
-Hurry up!

28:21.960 --> 28:24.440
-Don't take photos.
-It's Ms. Aum.

28:24.560 --> 28:26.400
Calm down, Ball. Calm down.

28:26.480 --> 28:28.520
-Stay away.
-Take photos for me.

28:42.200 --> 28:43.120
You are aware

28:44.080 --> 28:47.040
that Chin's father
is the main sponsor of our school, right?

28:49.280 --> 28:50.240
You are lucky

28:51.320 --> 28:54.040
that I talked him out
of pressing charges against you.

28:56.440 --> 28:58.240
I warned you before.

29:00.200 --> 29:03.400
I told you to take a break,
but you didn't listen.

29:06.600 --> 29:07.920
I'm really sorry.

29:18.280 --> 29:20.720
-Choice C.
-Next.

29:20.800 --> 29:22.320
-It's choice A.
-It's choice A.

29:22.400 --> 29:24.400
What's the answer to question 33?

29:24.480 --> 29:26.480
-Choice B.
