31:05.280 --> 31:06.440
SHOCKING!

31:06.520 --> 31:08.960
CRAZY TEACHER STABBED
MALE STUDENT IN SCHOOL

31:09.040 --> 31:10.840
ANOTHER INCIDENT AGAIN.
WHAT A BAD TEACHER!

31:10.920 --> 31:12.920
SHE THOUGHT SHE CAN DO ANYTHING
JUST BECAUSE SHE'S A TEACHER?

31:13.000 --> 31:14.720
IS SHE THE WIFE OF THE PROFESSOR
WHO GOT A STUDENT PREGNANT?

31:14.800 --> 31:16.280
THEY ARE BOTH EVIL!

31:16.360 --> 31:18.000
I'LL SPREAD THE NEWS,
SO THEIR CAREER PATHS WILL BE DOOMED!

31:18.080 --> 31:19.280
HOW DID THEY BECOME TEACHERS?

31:19.360 --> 31:20.480
THEY SHOULDN'T HAVE BEEN BORN.

31:20.560 --> 31:21.720
I WISH THEIR CHILD WILL BE SCREWED.

31:21.800 --> 31:22.720
GO FUCK YOURSELVES, BAD TEACHERS!

31:23.880 --> 31:27.600
I think your teaching style
might be too harsh on the kids.

31:28.840 --> 31:31.920
Someone like you
will never be the deputy director.

31:32.320 --> 31:36.440
Please take another look at yourself.

31:41.880 --> 31:43.160
Can we talk?

31:43.240 --> 31:45.320
Are you going to live with that bitch?

31:45.960 --> 31:48.280
Dad, where are you going?

31:48.360 --> 31:50.200
Take me with you.

31:53.640 --> 31:57.920
Dad, where are you going?
Take me with you.

31:58.000 --> 32:00.560
I don't want to live with Mom.

32:03.120 --> 32:06.040
-Why do you want to be with a bad person?
-I want to live with Dad.

32:06.640 --> 32:08.600
I don't want to live with Mom.

32:09.920 --> 32:11.840
Shut up! Shut the fuck up!

32:12.400 --> 32:14.120
Shut up now!

32:14.200 --> 32:16.880
-I want to live with Dad.
-Shut up!

32:16.960 --> 32:18.760
-Shut the fuck up!
-I want to be with Dad.

32:18.840 --> 32:20.360
-Shut up!
-I feel sorry for her.

32:21.000 --> 32:22.840
She lost her husband

32:22.920 --> 32:25.120
-and now her son.
-Shut up!

32:26.160 --> 32:28.160
My child and I are fine.

32:30.520 --> 32:32.720
Shut up!

32:33.120 --> 32:34.640
Don't leave me.

32:35.200 --> 32:37.160
I love you so much.

33:18.200 --> 33:20.760
GREETING AREA

34:03.360 --> 34:06.160
We will also announce

34:06.840 --> 34:08.480
