the new deputy director.

34:12.159 --> 34:13.000
This award goes to...

34:58.000 --> 34:58.960
Ms. Aum.

34:59.480 --> 35:00.480
What are you doing here?

36:05.360 --> 36:06.640
WORAWEE PRASITIKULPAISARN
THE MOST DISCIPLINED STUDENT

36:56.320 --> 36:57.480
I just realized

36:58.080 --> 37:00.960
how beautiful this place is.

37:01.480 --> 37:02.480
Is that so?

37:04.840 --> 37:06.320
But this is not the end.

37:07.200 --> 37:08.800
Of course it's not the end.

37:09.560 --> 37:10.720
There will be other schools

37:11.280 --> 37:12.400
after this one.

37:14.120 --> 37:15.640
Do you think your small action today

37:16.480 --> 37:18.200
will change the whole world?

37:20.080 --> 37:22.120
I must thank you very much

37:22.960 --> 37:24.520
for making me realize.

37:53.840 --> 37:55.400
Are you going to kill me

37:56.680 --> 37:58.120
for justice?

38:02.800 --> 38:04.200
I can't help it.

38:05.400 --> 38:06.400
Because you

38:07.520 --> 38:09.160
look too much like that bitch.

38:11.640 --> 38:12.800
How about the others?

38:18.640 --> 38:20.040
I did it for everyone.

38:21.080 --> 38:22.480
Don't you see

38:22.560 --> 38:23.800
that these people

38:24.680 --> 38:27.480
are ruining the educational system?

38:28.680 --> 38:31.120
I will redeem it.

38:34.160 --> 38:35.160
Because...

38:35.960 --> 38:38.520
I'm not a teacher
who only does teaching in class.

38:41.440 --> 38:43.960
Is this your plan
to reform the educational system?

38:49.960 --> 38:51.160
Or perhaps...

38:52.920 --> 38:55.200
you are just someone who failed in life

38:56.480 --> 38:57.600
and decided to blame

38:58.400 --> 38:59.560
the system and other people.

39:01.080 --> 39:02.480
You think you're right

39:03.160 --> 39:04.920
when in fact, you're selfish.

39:07.720 --> 39:08.840
Sometimes,

39:09.760 --> 39:11.720
the people who think they are always right

39:14.000 --> 39:15.960
can be the most pathetic people.

39:16.520 --> 39:17.760
Shut your mouth!

39:22.360 --> 39:23.440
I did the right thing.

39:25.200 --> 39:26.560
I did it for everyone.

39:28.160 --> 39:29.400
I'm a good person.

